+// A kept bag of `gems` is full: its tribute (a turn end per 10 gems, a third fewer with a Tribute emblem) would run
+// past params::hoard_channel. The win then needs that one channel whole, and any lock on its altar or stun cancels it:
+// live against Fish r8 our channels of 41-70 turn ends completed 24% of the time and winning bags of 700+ gems
+// converted 73% against 98% under 500. The carry (sole_capture_holder, left_for_prism, farm's 'G', 'L', 'Q') stops
+// there, and the allies bank what they capture.
+bool hoard_full(int gems, bool fast) { return tribute_turns(gems, fast) > params::hoard_channel; }
